WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.640
As of 15 May 2019

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:08.700
calls to other EU countries are cheaper

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.800
from landlines and mobile phones

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.720
Thanks to new EU rules

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:23.900
prices will not exceed 19 cents per minute +VAT for a call
and 6 cents +VAT per SMS 

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.200
this is up to 10x cheaper than before 

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.700
So from now on 

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.760
call your friends and family living abroad

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:40.600
without fear of high prices

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.660
Together with the end of roaming fees

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:48.920
Europeans are now fully covered against bill shocks

